cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it as below."
title: "TraceForge: Observable Microservice Lab"
abstract: >-
  A controlled, experiment-first testbed that measures the performance and resource
  cost of observability instrumentation in a containerized microservice system. It
  compares five additive observability modes (none, metrics, +logs, +traces, full
  OpenTelemetry pipeline) against a true uninstrumented baseline with statistical
  rigor (open-model load, bootstrap confidence intervals, non-parametric tests,
  effect sizes), measures objective failure detection (MTTD via alert firing), and
  includes PostgreSQL/MongoDB indexing and Compose-vs-Swarm-vs-Kubernetes comparisons.
